('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:727149', 'Moonflower Stealth Princess, Lisciafael "Fantome"', 'Normal Unit · Dragon Empire', 'Triple Rare', '[AUTO](VC)[1/Turn]:When this unit attacks, [COST][Counter-Blast 1] & put two or more rear-guards into soul], and search your deck for up to one unit card with "Moonflower" in its card name for every two cards put into soul for this cost. Call the searched cards each to a (RC) in the same column, and shuffle the deck. All of your front row units get [Power]+5000 until end of turn for every two cards put into soul for this cost.
 [Fantôme Skill] - [AUTO](VC)[1/Turn]:When this unit is attacked, [COST][bind a Crimson Moon card from hand, soul, or drop], choose any number of cards each with "Moonflower" in their different card names from your soul, and call them to (GC).', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/727149_200w.jpg', 'DZ-BT16: Parallactic Dawn', 'DZ-BT16', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/727149'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:727150', 'Exacerbate Dragon', 'Normal Unit · Dragon Empire', 'Triple Rare', '[AUTO]:When this unit is placed on (RC), if you have a vanguard with "Youth" in its card name, [COST][Counter-Blast 1], and perform one of the following.
