 Choose a <Fantôme> unit card from your drop, and call it to (RC).
 [AUTO](RC):When your grade 3 or greater vanguard with "Youthberk" in its card name attacks, this unit gets [Power]+5000 until end of turn.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/727150_200w.jpg', 'DZ-BT16: Parallactic Dawn', 'DZ-BT16', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/727150'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:727151', 'Moonflower Stealth Fiend, Albellina', 'Normal Unit · Dragon Empire', 'Triple Rare', '[AUTO]:When this unit is placed on (RC), if you have a vanguard with "Moonflower" in its card name, [COST][Counter-Blast 1], look at the top seven cards of your deck, choose up to one unit card with grade less than or equal to your vanguard and a different card name from this unit from among them, call it to (RC), and shuffle the deck. If you did not call a card, draw a card.
 [CONT](RC):During your turn, if you have a grade 3 or greater vanguard with "Lisciafael" in its card name, this unit gets [Power]+5000.
 [AUTO](RC)[1/Turn]:At the end of the battle this unit attacked a grade 3 or greater unit, if this unit was placed by the ability of your <Fantôme> vanguard with "Lisciafael" in its card name this turn, [COST][Energy-Blast 3], [Stand] this unit, if this unit''s [Critical] is 2 or greater, until end of turn, this unit gets [Power]+10000, and its [Critical] becomes 1.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/727151_200w.jpg', 'DZ-BT16: Parallactic Dawn', 'DZ-BT16', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/727151'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:727152', 'Steam Diva, Artisaria "Fantome"', 'Normal Unit · Dark States', 'Triple Rare', '[ACT](VC)[1/Turn]:[COST][Rest] a rear-guard], choose a Sound System card from your hand, soul, or drop, and put it in the order zone. If you put a card from hand, draw a card.
 [AUTO](VC):At the beginning of your battle phase, if your opponent''s vanguard is grade 3 or greater, all of your front row units get [Power]+5000 until end of turn.
