('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:727153', 'Resilience Dragon', 'Normal Unit · Dark States', 'Triple Rare', '[AUTO]:When this unit is placed on (RC) from hand or deck, if you have a grade 3 or greater vanguard with "Gabwelius" in its card name, [COST][Counter-Blast 1], and perform one of the following.
