('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:727154', 'Steam Blader, Shrikt', 'Normal Unit · Dark States', 'Triple Rare', '[AUTO]:If you have a vanguard with "Artisaria" in its card name, this ability''s cost can be paid with "[Energy-Blast 3]". When this unit is placed on (RC), choose a grade 3 with "Artisaria" in its card name from your ride deck, and you may reveal it. If you revealed a card, or you have a grade 3 or greater vanguard with "Artisaria" in its card name, [COST][Counter-Blast 1], look at the top five cards of your deck, choose up to one card with a different card name from this unit from among them, reveal it, put it into hand if it is a Crimson Moon card or a Sound System card, and call it to (RC) if it is a unit card with grade less than or equal to your vanguard. Shuffle the deck. If you did not reveal a card from deck, draw a card.
