('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722054', 'Tae Hanazono [Better Sound] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[AUTO](RC):When your vanguard''s drive check reveals a trigger card, if you have a vanguard with "Kasumi Toyama" in its card name, [COST][Soul-Blast 1], and perform one of the following according to the number of times you paid this ability''s cost this turn.
•Once - This unit gets [Power]+10000 until end of turn.
•Twice - Until end of turn, when your opponent would call cards from hand to (GC) for the battles this unit attacked, they must call two or more at the same time.
•Thrice - This unit gets [Critical]+1 until end of turn.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722054_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722054'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722055', 'Rimi Ushigome [Toy Friends] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[ACT](RC)[1/Turn]:If you have a vanguard with "Kasumi Toyama" in its card name, [COST][Counter-Blast 1] or put a <Poppin''Party> from hand into soul], and draw a card. If your opponent''s vanguard is grade 3 or greater, until end of turn, this unit gets [Power]+5000, choose one of your <Poppin''Party> rear-guards, and it gets [Power]+10000.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722055_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722055'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722056', 'Saya Yamabuki [Poster Girl] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[ACT](RC)[1/Turn]:If you have a grade 3 or greater vanguard with "Kasumi Toyama" in its card name, this cost can be paid with "[Energy-Blast 3]". [COST][Counter-Blast 1], choose a <Poppin''Party> from your drop, and call it to (RC).', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722056_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722056'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722057', 'Arisa Ichigaya [Unstoppable Force!] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[AUTO](RC):At the end of the battle this unit boosted a <Poppin''Party>, [COST][put this unit into soul], and draw a card.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722057_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722057'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722058', 'Ran Mitake [A Vow at the End] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[ACT](VC)[1/Turn]:[COST][Energy-Blast] any number], and choose an <Afterglow> from your drop for every [Energy-Blast 1] paid for this cost. Call all of the chosen cards to (RC).
 [ACT](VC):If you did not play an order this turn, [COST][Counter-Blast 1], search your deck or drop for up to one <Afterglow> Music and play it, and if you searched the deck, shuffle the deck.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722058_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722058'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722059', 'Moca Aoba [Bread from a Hero] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[AUTO]Front Row Left (RC):When this unit attacks, if you have a grade 3 or greater vanguard with "Ran Mitake" in its card name, [COST][Soul-Blast 1], and this unit gets [Power]+5000 until end of turn. If it is the second time you paid this ability''s cost this turn, draw a card.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722059_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722059'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722060', 'Himari Uehara [Shout] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[AUTO]:When this unit is placed on a front row right (RC), [COST][Counter-Blast 1], look at the top seven cards of your deck, choose up to one <Afterglow> from among them, reveal it and put it into hand, and shuffle the deck. If you have a grade 3 or greater vanguard with "Ran Mitake" in its card name, until end of turn, this unit gets [Power]+5000, and if you revealed a card with "Himari Uehara" in its card name, it also gets [Critical]+1.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722060_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722060'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722061', 'Tomoe Udagawa [Clear and Vivid Orange] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[AUTO]Back Row Left (RC)/Hand:At the beginning of the guard step of the battle your <Afterglow> unit was attacked, [COST][put this card into drop], choose one of the units being attacked, and it gets [Power]+10000 until end of that battle,', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722061_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722061'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722062', 'Tsugumi Hazawa [In My Own Words] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[AUTO](RC):At the end of the battle this unit boosted, [COST][Energy-Blast 3] & put this unit into soul], search your deck for up to one <Afterglow> with the same card name as your vanguard, reveal it and put it into hand, and shuffle the deck.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722062_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722062'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722063', 'Aya Maruyama [A True Idol Fanatic] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[AUTO](VC):At the beginning of your battle phase, choose up to two <PastelÔºäPalettes> from your drop, choose up to one card from the chosen cards, call it to (RC), and put the rest into soul. If your soul has fifteen or more cards, this unit gets [Critical]+1 until end of turn.
 [ACT](VC):If you did not play an order this turn, [COST][Counter-Blast 1], search your deck or drop for up to one <PastelÔºäPalettes> Music and play it, and if you searched the deck, shuffle the deck.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722063_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722063'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722064', 'Hina Hikawa [Athletics Master] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[AUTO]Front Row Left (RC):At the end of the battle this unit attacked, if you have a vanguard with "Aya Maruyama" in its card name, [COST][put this unit into soul], draw a card, [COST][Counter-Blast 1], and draw a card.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722064_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722064'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722065', 'Chisato Shirasagi [Supporting Each Other] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[AUTO]Front Row Right (RC)[1/Turn]:When this unit attacks, if your grade 3 or greater vanguard with "Aya Maruyama" in its card name is [Stand], this unit gets [Power]+5000 until end of turn. Then, at the end of that battle, [COST][Energy-Blast 3], [Stand] this unit, until end of turn, it gets [Power]+5000, and if your soul has ten or more cards, it also gets [Critical]+1.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722065_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722065'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722066', 'Maya Yamato [What Lies Ahead] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[ACT](RC)[1/Turn]:If you have a grade 3 or greater vanguard with "Aya Maruyama" in its card name, [COST][Energy-Blast 3] or put a card from hand into soul], choose a <PastelÔºäPalettes> with a different card name from all of your rear-guards from your soul, and call it to (RC).', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722066_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722066'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:722067', 'Eve Wakamiya [How''s My Voice?] (GBPR+)', 'Normal Unit · BanG Dream!', 'GBPR+', '[AUTO]:When this unit is placed on (RC) or put on (GC), if you have a vanguard with "Aya Maruyama" in its card name, you may reveal the top card of your deck. If you revealed a card, put that revealed card into soul, and this unit gets [Power]+5000/[Shield]+5000 until end of turn. If the revealed card has "Aya Maruyama" in its card name, when it would be put into soul, you may put it into hand instead.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/722067_200w.jpg', 'DZ-TBP01: BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!', 'DZ-TBP01', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/722067'),
