 [COST][Energy-Blast 2], look at the top card of your deck, put it on the bottom of the deck or into soul, choose one of your opponent''s rear-guards, and put it into soul.

 [AUTO](RC):When this unit attacks, if your opponent''s vanguard is grade 3 or greater, this unit gets [Power]+5000 until end of that battle. If you have a vanguard with only one clan, it gets [Power]+5000 until end of that battle if your opponent''s vanguard is grade 2 or greater instead of grade 3 or greater.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/708747_200w.jpg', 'DZ-SS15: The Legendary Vanguards', 'DZ-SS15', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/708747'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:708748', 'Giant Deity of Distant World, Valkerion (SR)', 'ไม่ระบุ', 'Silver Rare', '[CONT]:This card cannot be ridden, and cannot [Stand] by a card''s ability. If your vanguard does not have a Shinemon icon, this card''s original grade becomes 0, and its original [Power] becomes 0.

 [CONT](Drop):This card cannot be chosen by your opponent''s card effects.

 [AUTO]:When this unit is on a non-Astral Plane circle, retire this unit. If it was not retired, remove this unit.

 [AUTO]:When this unit is placed on an Astral Plane, if you have five or more Astral Plane gauges, look at the top five cards of your deck, choose a card from among them, discard it, and shuffle the deck. If you discarded a <Keter Sanctuary>, until end of turn, this unit''s drive is the same as the grade of the discarded card.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/708748_200w.jpg', 'DZ-SS15: The Legendary Vanguards', 'DZ-SS15', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/708748'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:716201', 'Astral Plane', 'Token · Dark Zone · Angel Feather', 'Token', 'This (RC) is an Astral Plane. Astral Planes have the following rules.

• Grade is ignored when calling an "Astral Deity".

• If the card on the Astral Plane is not an "Astral Deity", put it into the drop zone.

• The unit on the Astral Plane can attack from the back row, and performs drive checks. Cards revealed for those drive checks are put into your soul instead of your hand.

• At the end of your turn, put the unit on the Astral Plane on the bottom of your deck.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/716201_200w.jpg', 'DZ-SS15: The Legendary Vanguards', 'DZ-SS15', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/716201'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:702038', 'Youthberk "Draegforce Arms: Fantome"', 'Normal Unit · Dragon Empire', 'Triple Rare', '[DrægDress] - [AUTO](VC):At the end of the battle this unit attacked, choose up to one card with "DrægForm" in its card name from your hand, ride it as [Stand], and it gets drive -2 until end of turn. If you rode a card, at the end of that turn, choose a "Youthberk "Drægforce Arms: Fantôme"" from your soul, and ride it as [Rest].
 [ACT](VC)[1/Turn]:[COST][Discard a card from hand], look at the top three cards of your deck, choose up to one card with "DrægForm" in its card name or up to one grade 2 or less card from among them, reveal it, put it into hand if it is a card with "DrægForm" in its card name, and call it to (RC) if it is not. You may discard all of the remaining cards. If you did not discard them, put them on the bottom of the deck in any order.
 [AUTO](VC):At the beginning of your main phase, you get "When your vanguard attacks, that unit gets [Power]+1000 until end of that battle for each card in your drop with <Dragon> in its race." until end of turn.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/702038_200w.jpg', 'DZ-BT14: Envoys of the Crimson Moon', 'DZ-BT14', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/702038'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:702039', 'Youthberk "DraegForm: Dynast"', 'Normal Unit · Dragon Empire', 'Triple Rare', '[CONT](Deck):If you have a vanguard with "Youth" in its card name, while this card is revealed by a Crimson Moon card''s ability, this card is regarded as a Crimson Moon card.
 [AUTO]:When this unit is placed on (VC) by the [DrægDress] ability, perform all of the following.
 All of your front row rear-guards get [Power]+5000 until end of turn. If your opponent''s vanguard is grade 3 or greater, they also get [Power]+5000.
 [COST][Counter-Blast 1], and this unit gets drive +1 until end of turn. If your opponent''s vanguard is grade 3 or greater, it also gets [Critical]+1.
 [Fantôme Skill] - [AUTO](VC)[1/Turn]:When this unit attacks, [COST][bind one or more, up to two Crimson Moon cards in total from hand, soul, or drop], choose the same number of your opponent''s rear-guards as the number of cards bound for this cost, retire them, and all of your front row units get [Power]+5000 until end of turn. If your bind zone has three or more Crimson Moon cards, they also get [Power]+5000.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/702039_200w.jpg', 'DZ-BT14: Envoys of the Crimson Moon', 'DZ-BT14', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/702039'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:702040', 'Mythisch of Unparalleled, Zalva Dragnia', 'Normal Unit · Dragon Empire', 'Triple Rare', '[AUTO]:When this unit is placed on (RC) from hand, [COST][Soul-Blast 1], look at the top seven cards of your deck, choose up to one unit card with "Varga" in its card name from among them, reveal it and put it into hand, and shuffle the deck.
