 [CONT](RC):During your turn, this unit gets [Power]+5000, and if all other rear-guards in the same row as this unit have different card names from this unit, this unit gets "Boost", and cannot be retired by your card effects.
 [AUTO](RC)[1/Turn]:When your vanguard [Stand] during the battle phase, until end of turn, this unit gets [Power]+5000, if all other rear-guards in the same row as this unit have different card names from this unit, and you used a [Divine Skill] this fight, [COST][Energy-Blast 3], and this unit''s [Critical] also becomes 2.', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/702040_200w.jpg', 'DZ-BT14: Envoys of the Crimson Moon', 'DZ-BT14', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/702040'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:702041', 'Dragritter, Uathaach', 'Normal Unit · Dragon Empire', 'Triple Rare', '[AUTO]:When this unit is placed on (RC) from hand or placed on (RC) by a Crimson Moon card''s ability, look at the top five cards of your deck, choose up to one card with <Dragon> in its race and up to one order card each from among them, discard them, and shuffle the deck.
