('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:702042', 'Demonic Lord Dragon, Gabwelius "Fantome"', 'Normal Unit · Dark States', 'Triple Rare', '[AUTO](VC):When this unit attacks, [COST][Counter-Blast 1] & put two rear-guards into soul], choose up to two grade 3 or less cards from your drop, call them each to a (RC) in the same column, and at the end of that turn, put all of the called units into soul.
