('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:551759', 'Training Equipment', 'Set Order · Touken Ranbu', 'RR', '(You can have a total of five cards in your ride deck made up of this card, a unit card without "Kiwame" in its card name and one unit card each from grade 0 to grade 2, and this card is put face up)

