('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:219118', 'Storm Element, Cycloned', 'G · Other · Cray Elemental', 'Generation Rare', '"[Stride]-Stride Step-[COST][Choose one or more cards with the sum of their grades being 3 or greater from your hand, and discard them]
[Stride] this card on your (VC) from face down.

[CONT]{(VC)/G zone}:During your turn, if this card is face up, all of your units without any [CONT], [ACT], or [AUTO] abilities get [Power]+5000.

[AUTO]{(VC)}:When a normal unit without any [CONT], [ACT], or [AUTO] abilities is revealed for the drive check in the battle this unit attacked, [Stand] one of your rear-guards."', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/219118_200w.jpg', 'V-SS05: Premium Collection 2020', 'V-SS05', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/219118'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:219119', 'Holy Dragon, Crystaluster Dragon', 'G · United Sanctuary · Royal Paladin', 'RRR', '"[Stride]-Stride Step-[COST][Choose one or more cards with the sum of their grades being 3 or greater from your hand, and discard them]
[Stride] this card on your (VC) from face down.

[ACT]{(VC)}[1/turn]:[COST][Turn a card from your G zone face up], and until end of turn, this unit gets all of the original abilities of one of your heart cards.

[CONT]{(VC)}[Generation Break 3]:If you have three or more grade 2 or greater units, when your opponent would call from his or her hand to (GC), he or she must call three or more at the same time."', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/219119_200w.jpg', 'V-SS05: Premium Collection 2020', 'V-SS05', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/219119'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:219130', 'Sterling Witch, MoMo', 'G · United Sanctuary · Oracle Think Tank', 'RRR', '"[Stride]-Stride Step-[COST][Choose one or more cards with the sum of their grades being 3 or greater from your hand, and discard them]
[Stride] this card on your (VC) from face down.

[AUTO]{(VC)}[1/turn]:When it attacks, [COST][[Counter-Blast 1] & turn a card from your G zone face up], discard up to three cards from your hand, and for each card discarded, three of your front row units get [Power]+10000 until end of turn. If you discarded three cards, at the end of that battle, [Stand] this unit, and it gets drive -2."', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/219130_200w.jpg', 'V-SS05: Premium Collection 2020', 'V-SS05', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/219130'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:219139', 'Holy Seraph, Basasael', 'G · United Sanctuary · Angel Feather', 'RRR', '"[Stride]-Stride Step-[COST][Choose one or more cards with the sum of their grades being 3 or greater from your hand, and discard them]
[Stride] this card on your (VC) from face down.

[AUTO]{(VC)}[Generation Break 3]:When placed, until end of this fight, the number of cards in your damage zone for you to lose becomes seven. If your G zone had five or more face up cards when this unit was placed, it becomes eight cards instead of seven.

[ACT]{(VC)}:[COST][Counter-Blast 4], and until end of turn, when your opponent would call from his or her hand to (GC), he or she must call the same number of cards as the number of cards in your damage zone or more at the same time."', 'https://cdn.tcgtracking.com/product/219139_200w.jpg', 'V-SS05: Premium Collection 2020', 'V-SS05', 'https://openapi.tcgtracking.com/v1/products/219139'),
('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:219143', 'Dark Dragon, Chainrancor Dragon', 'G · United Sanctuary · Shadow Paladin', 'RRR', '"[Stride]-Stride Step-[COST][Choose one or more cards with the sum of their grades being 3 or greater from your hand, and discard them]
