('vanguard', 'tcgtracking:219156', 'Golden Dragon, Brambent Dragon', 'G · United Sanctuary · Gold Paladin', 'RRR', '"[Stride]-Stride Step-[COST][Choose one or more cards with the sum of their grades being 3 or greater from your hand, and discard them]
